<title>ESTONIA: Estonia's trade deficit in July 1.28 bln kroons.</title>
<headline>Estonia's trade deficit in July 1.28 bln kroons.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1996-09-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonia's trade deficit in July was 1.28 billion kroons, the national statistics department said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    ESTONIAN TRADE BALANCE   July 96   June 96   July 95</p>
<p>    Exports			1.7	   N/A	  N/A</p>
<p>    Imports			2.9	   N/A	  N/A</p>
<p>    Trade balance	     -1.28	  1.01	 N/A</p>
<p>Note - Figures in billions of kroons.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom +3717-22 66 93</p>
</text>
